  "properties": {
    "title": "Open source tech for fast vector webmaps: Brazilian farms use case",
    "description": "How do you show a big Vector dataset on a map on the web? Not showing it at all! Just show small parts at once with a little help from open source geospatial tech. \r\nWhile image basemap tiles and pyramids system is well know, Vector Tile Layers and API's still among the bleeding edge technologies that allows to show big vector datasets on the web efficiently. On this talk we will discuss how to move from a slow to a fast vector map rendering on the web. \r\nLast but not least: a word on how to run it at home with spare parts you might have helping you go online while avoid high cloud computing costs.",
